# WASM backend residual

**Status:** residual honesty (smoke depth only). PM **4.1.4**. **Marker:** `WASM_SMOKE_RESIDUAL_ALPHA`

## What emit is

`oodac emit-wasm` and `ooda build --target wasm` write **WebAssembly text** (`.wat`).
That is not a `.wasm` product. wasmtime is not required.

## Fail-closed residual

Do not treat this smoke backend as a production floor.

## What we do not claim

Not a shipped WASM runtime. Not a `.wasm` binary. Not wasmtime/WASI execute. Not a second self-host.

## Rails

- `WASM_SMOKE_RESIDUAL_ALPHA`
- `scripts/wasm_emit_smoke.oo` — emit `.wat` text
- `scripts/wasm_smoke_residual_smoke.sh` — residual (that `.sh` is not on disk; the `.oo` honesty check is)
